        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The NVIDIA Vera CPU provides 88 Olympus cores with 1.8x faster single-threaded performance and up to 1.5 TB of LPDDR5X connected coherently to Rubin at 1.8 TB/s over NVLink-C2C, staging idle KV cache during tool calls.",
