      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA CMX adds a pod-level G3.5 storage tier built on BlueField-4 STX, Spectrum-X, DOCA Memos, and Dynamo integration to share and reuse KV cache across nodes.",
