        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:36.829Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Together these five co-designed levers enable Vera Rubin NVL72 to deliver up to 30x the throughput per megawatt of GB300 NVL72 from the same 288 GB per GPU.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/five-ways-nvidia-co-design-maximizes-the-value-of-every-byte-in-the-ai-factory/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
